WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.077 --> 00:00:09.702
So don't worry, I

00:00:09.702 --> 00:00:14.366
wish I could

00:00:14.366 --> 00:00:18.620
protect you without your knowledge.

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:25.282
The story has only just begun.

00:00:25.282 --> 00:00:27.986
Even without a destination,

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:32.394
on an unexplored road, I implore you to

00:00:32.394 --> 00:00:36.562
move forward amidst confusion. I implore

00:00:36.562 --> 00:00:44.515
hope to exist there and be with you.

00:00:44.515 --> 00:00:45.902
We are…

00:00:45.902 --> 00:00:48.731
I hope you can gain wings

00:00:50.651 --> 00:00:53.059
so you can fly anywhere and

00:00:53.059 --> 00:01:01.270
dispel any darkness.

00:01:01.270 --> 00:01:04.223
You gave me Holy bravery. Move

00:01:04.223 --> 00:01:08.821
forward fearlessly. Oh Holy bravery, there will always

00:01:08.821 --> 00:01:12.962
be a Holy trace when you look back.

00:01:12.962 --> 00:01:17.621
You are smiling,

00:01:19.468 --> 00:01:22.556
so stay Holy brave.

00:01:22.556 --> 00:01:27.000
Even if you fall, carry Holy bravery with you.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:31.331
I will take steps forward, heading towards the distance, to where

00:01:31.331 --> 00:01:36.618
you are.

00:01:42.291 --> 00:01:49.373
All those unintentional words and gestures have instantly

00:01:49.373 --> 00:01:53.479
become eternal treasures. Yes,

00:01:53.479 --> 00:02:00.543
always pushing me forward. When

00:02:00.543 --> 00:02:07.446
that warm gaze, cherishing and lovingly

00:02:07.446 --> 00:02:14.100
enveloping me, I also whisper a prayer.

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:19.294
Yes, accept both fortune and misfortune together.

00:02:19.294 --> 00:02:21.318
We are…

00:02:21.318 --> 00:02:25.549
May these unfinished wings

00:02:25.549 --> 00:02:28.044
fly across the turbulent sea and

00:02:28.044 --> 00:02:36.454
dispel any storm.

00:02:36.454 --> 00:02:39.568
You gave me Holy bravery. Move

00:02:39.568 --> 00:02:44.133
forward fearlessly. Oh Holy bravery, there will always

00:02:44.133 --> 00:02:48.353
be a Holy trace when you look back.

00:02:48.353 --> 00:02:54.236
You are smiling,

00:02:54.236 --> 00:02:57.583
so stay Holy brave.

00:02:57.583 --> 00:03:02.224
Even if you fall, carry Holy bravery with you.

00:03:02.224 --> 00:03:06.125
I will take steps forward, heading towards the distance.

00:03:06.125 --> 00:03:12.537
Heading towards where you are, through the

00:03:12.537 --> 00:03:17.317
deep waves before dawn, we move

00:03:17.317 --> 00:03:21.720
forward (We are…)

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:26.291
following your footsteps.

00:03:26.291 --> 00:03:30.749
I'm on my way,

00:03:30.749 --> 00:03:33.586
so stay Holy brave and move

00:03:33.586 --> 00:03:38.070
forward without fear. Oh Holy brave, when I look

00:03:38.070 --> 00:03:42.598
back there is always a Holy trace.

00:03:42.598 --> 00:03:47.185
You smile,

00:03:48.843 --> 00:03:51.756
please look at me. Holy brave,

00:03:51.756 --> 00:03:56.096
even if I fall, I will carry Holy brave with me so

00:03:56.096 --> 00:04:00.816
I can take a step forward and head towards the distance, towards where

00:04:00.816 --> 00:04:06.596
you are.

00:04:07.076 --> 00:04:10.051
So don’t you worry,

00:04:10.051 --> 00:04:14.695
may I be able to

00:04:14.695 --> 00:04:19.099
protect you without your knowledge.

00:04:19.099 --> 00:04:27.000
The story has only just begun.

